  dialogueManager: {fileID: 631093950}
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Friendly Man
    text: Hey..
  - speakerName: You
    text: Yes, sir, can i help you?
  - speakerName: Friendly Man
    text: I think you're the one need help
  - speakerName: You
    text: What do you mean?
  - speakerName: Friendly Man
    text: I've seen it... the tall skinny creature, and the pig masked man
  - speakerName: You
    text: What do you mean sir?
  - speakerName: Friendly Man
    text: They killed the previous dude who work here before, devour him.... alive...
  - speakerName: You
    text: .......
  - speakerName: Friendly Man
    text: You're not from around here right? they always put people who aren't from
      around here, maybe you want to defend yourself
  - speakerName: You
    text: I don't understand what you are talking about sir
  - speakerName: Friendly Man
    text: 'Are you braindead or something? you really need to be explained? alright,
      this place isn''t safe, theres monster out here, but for some reason they only
      target outsider, that''s all '
  - speakerName: Friendly Man
    text: Maybe i'll see you again tomorrow, if you are alive, because this mart
      changes the person working here every day
